sequenceDiagram
  participant A as client A (current owner)
  participant H as rbd_header (cls_lock + watch)
  participant B as client B (new writer)
  B->>H: GET_LOCKER (lock rbd_lock)
  H-->>B: owner = A (EBUSY)
  B->>H: notify: REQUEST_LOCK
  H->>A: watch-notify
  alt A is healthy and the policy allows it
    A->>A: flush and release (PreRelease)
    A->>H: unlock
    B->>H: LOCK_IMAGE (cls_lock exclusive)
  else A is dead (no watch)
    B->>H: BREAK_LOCK (and blocklist A's address)
    B->>H: LOCK_IMAGE
  end
  Note over B: PostAcquire: open the object map and journal
